== Trivia ==
* {{IN|earth}}, there was a buttercup-covered variant of mooshrooms known as "[[moobloom]]s".<ref>{{tweet|jorax79|1151394648281120769|Mooblooms! A new mob variant in Minecraft Earth!|July 17, 2019}}</ref> This variant was also part of the [[Minecraft Live 2020]] Mob Vote. It came last and there are currently no known plans to add it to the game.
